Bind Npc 24432 Zone 1
Quest 478 "[Repeatable Solo] Hell Hound Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Guard] Keife has commissioned you to hunt Hell Hound. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 30 of 666, 616 at direction_37

Requires player level >= 57 and player is karus

Rewards
    Give 2500000 experience or 3750000 with premium

direction_37 = location "Hell Hound" about "Hell Hound\nGatekeeper of hell, a monster summoned from hell by Pathos' it's entire body is red" found "Karus" at 114 365 in zone 1

On available
    Say "Master, Shall we go some hunting and get some more experience? Hee Hee!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Are you going out to hunt? Hmm... How about hunting Hell Hounds?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Hell Hounds are meat-eating beasts that have their breeding grounds behind the Goblin Village. Its has a characteristically fast attack speed and is popular among hunters because it drops Talismans of Destruction. This hunt will be a great experience for you."

On in_progress
    Say "How's the hunt going? Experience doesn't always come easy. Cheer up!"
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_37

On ready
    Say "Well done! Should I give you a massage now? Hee Hee!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Hahahahaha!! You got wasted! Well done. I think."
